Package: DrugRepurposing
Type: Package
Title: Drug Repurposing System
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Carmelo", "Catalano", email="carmelo.c.mtb@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
 )
Description:
    Drug repurposing system based on transcriptome signature reversion, achieved through
    the analysis of gene expression data from disease and pharmacological studies.
    DrugRepurposing also provides highly efficient Differential Gene Expression (DGE)
    algorithms of two types: dichotomic and Linear Mixed Models (LMM).
License: GPLv3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: false
